Hero stats are separated into several different factors

The first is the seeded random generation from summoning

Hero Stat Overview:

Heroes will generated with 20 randomized stats. These stats will be used to determine the growth and starting values to be changes and updated overtime. 

The game will shape the hero, but their spawn will be predetermined

Base Stats:

** Based on general stats from observed video games Initial Values

Vit - Vitality
Str - Strength
Agi - Dexterity
Int - Intelligence
Cha - Charisma

Base Stat Potential:

** Growth values for general stats **

Vit-Pot - Vitality Potential
Str-Pot - Strength Potential
Agi-Pot - Agility Potential
Int-Pot - Intelligence Potential
Cha-Pot - Charisma Potential

Personality Stats:

** Based on the OCEAN or Big Five personality traits values between -1 and 1 **

OPN - Openness          *Curiosity, Imagination, Creativity, and willingness to try new things*
CSN - Conscientiousness *Organization, reliability, deiscipline, and goal directed behaviour*
XTR - Extraversion      *Socialbility, Assertiveness, Energy, and Stimulation Preference*
AGR - Agreeableness     *Compassion, Kindness, Cooperation, Trust in others*
NUR - Neuroticism       *Tendancy towards anxiety, moodiness, and emotional reactvity*

Energy Compatibilities:

** Values used to determine the heroes' ability to manipulate an Energy values between **

Mag - Magic     *The power of the magic weave*
Spr - Spirit    *The power of the spirits of the tower*
Cos - Cosmic    *The power of the energies of the cosmos*
Aur - Aura      *The power latent within mortality*
Div - Divinity  *The power gifted from beyond*






Hero Potential : 

The characters base stats are distributed by their potential

Character potential ratings 
| Name           | Rarity / 1024    | Growth Bonus |
|----------------|------------------|--------------|
| Celestial Hero |    1 -   1 (001) | 1.0          |
|----------------|------------------|--------------|
| Demigod Hero   |    2 -   3 (002) | 0.83         |
|----------------|------------------|--------------|
| Ascendant Hero |    4 -   7 (004) | 0.68         |
|----------------|------------------|--------------|
| Mythical Hero  |    8 -  15 (008) | 0.54         |
|----------------|------------------|--------------|
| Legendary Hero |   16 -  31 (016) | 0.42         |   
|----------------|------------------|--------------|
| Renowned Hero  |   32 -  63 (032) | 0.32         |
|----------------|------------------|--------------|
| Epic Hero      |   64 - 127 (064) | 0.25         |
|----------------|------------------|--------------|
| Notable Hero   |  128 - 255 (128) | 0.18         |
|----------------|------------------|--------------|
| Uncommon Hero  |  256 - 511 (256) | 0.13         |
|----------------|------------------|--------------|
| Common Hero    |  512 - 1024 (512)| 0.10         |
|----------------|------------------|--------------|


Each level the hero will gain previous_stat  

So while their base stats are flat, they will eventually grow to very high levels


The growth of a character is equal to this equation

L = Level
I = Initial Stat (1 - 10)
M - Max Stat Value (65536)
X = Max Level (250)
P = Potential (0-1)

New Stat (L) = (I / 10) * M * (1 - (1 - (L / X) ^^ (1 + 4*P)))

